window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Welcome to Nocturne Falls, the town that celebrates Halloween 365 days a year.</b><br> <br> The tourists think it's all a show: the vampires, the werewolves, the witches, the occasional gargoyle flying through the sky. But the supernaturals populating the town know better.<br> <br> Living in Nocturne Falls means being yourself. Fangs, fur, and all.<br> <br> Sydney Marlowe is making big changes to her life. She’s retired from her modelling career and sold her cosmetics company, all to live her dream of being a trad wife in a small town. She just needs to find a husband, something she’s confident won’t be a problem. Especially if she can learn to cook.<br> <br> Gargoyle Adam Rockford is in Nocturne Falls temporarily. He’s agreed to help at the fountain so another gargoyle can take some time off. It’s the perfect chance to recuperate from the devastating heartache of his recent breakup. He has no interest in another relationship anytime soon, but he didn’t count on a woman moving in next door who shares a lot of his same dreams.<br> <br> Too bad she’s human. Then again, his last girlfriend was a real witch…</p>"; 
